 "summary": "Three grades of N-channel junction FET switching transistors, rated 30 V drain-source and gate-source, in the three-lead SOT-23. The grades are sorted by zero-gate-voltage drain current: 50 to 150 mA for the MMBF4391, 25 to 75 mA for the MMBF4392 and 5 to 30 mA for the MMBF4393, with on-resistance limits of 30, 60 and 100 Ω and gate-source cutoff ranges of −4 to −10 V, −2 to −5 V and −0.5 to −3 V. S-prefixed versions are AEC-Q101 qualified and PPAP capable.",
